---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdRow from '../components/AdRow.astro';
---
<Layout title="Corrections" current="About">
  <section class="page prose">
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>We want what we publish to be right. When we get something wrong, we fix it and say so.</p>
    <h3>What we correct</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Guides and columns.</b> If a fact, phone number or link in something we wrote is wrong or out of date, we fix it and note the change on the page, with the date.</li>
      <li><b>Short summaries.</b> If a headline summary or “why it matters” line misstates the story it links to, we fix or remove it.</li>
      <li><b>Original reporting by other outlets.</b> Headlines link to the outlet that reported them. If you think the original story is wrong, contact that outlet. We will update our summary if they correct it.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>How to report a mistake</h3>
    <p>Use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>. Tell us the page, what is wrong and, if you can, a source showing what is right.</p>
    <h3>Corrections log</h3>
    <p>No corrections so far. We will list them here, with dates, as they happen.</p>
    <AdRow />
  </section>
</Layout>
